{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47721","headline":"又诗二首 一 · 马湘","name":"又诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"省悟前非一息间，更抛闲事弃尘寰。\n徒夸美酒如琼液，休恋娇娥似玉颜。\n含笑谩教情面厚，多愁还使鬓毛斑。\n云中幸有堪归路，无限青山是我山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马湘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}